{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_08_beg","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_08","title":"最後的怯薛","storyCode":"NL-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0ea61ed205e44a981ee42ff948167685b50b36718ce57fcd76e8e5bea96efee6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 8-1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"突然出現的冠軍，以雷霆之勢阻止一觸即發的二人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚的比賽由於逐魘騎士的法術涉嫌違規而遭到終止，而阻止了事態進一步惡化的人，正是“英雄”血騎士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而逐魘騎士與耀騎士也以平手告終，逐魘騎士接下來將直接與因對手投降而輪空的血騎士交戰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"平手......？逐魘犯規，難道不該讓耀騎士晉級嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們不希望感染者順利晉級，當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"瑟奇亞克人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他剛和家人見面，給他一點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......說真的，我對他本來沒什麼好感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"都看得出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，原來你沒打算表現得那麼露骨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但他也是個有血有肉的人，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市經常讓我們忘了這點......我們都是活著的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我們應該有自己的選擇，有自己的生活，而不是......在無盡的浪潮中，迷失自我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士與逐魘騎士的曠世之戰，將在明晚打響！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請各位觀眾，鎖定騎士之夜頻道，明晚八點，為您帶來絕佳的觀戰體驗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正義騎士號”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（響亮的滴滴聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......正義號！你沒事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜！你還不能隨便下床......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"來，扶著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿......謝啦，小灰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰是我獨享的綽號吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，借來一用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"要付版權費的喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾沃娜，那天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我看到了血騎士的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......現場有鮮血法術的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是種......很糟糕的法術。現在，單純的施法都會讓我感到疼痛，難以想像操縱那種法術，血騎士要遭受多大的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......血騎士......他很強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"有血騎士，才有了感染者騎士的參賽機制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......成為聯合會的玩物......失去尊嚴和自由......但是，我們活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活著才有機會奔跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......耀騎士和血騎士，你們更支持哪一方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......血騎士。毫無疑問，他才是真正為感染者開闢了未來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們需要的是不懈的鬥爭，而不是安於現狀......我選擇耀騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我選索娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還能這樣啊！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......您找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......董事會已經決定......對零號地塊實施清理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現階段的感染者策略是錯誤的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"錯誤呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，羅德島的領導人對零號地塊的調查有些深入了。這也是無胄盟的失誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾位常務董事強烈要求無胄盟斬草除根。不能讓羅德島的醫療小隊安然離開卡西米爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。但是，不是董事會全體的命令，而是“幾位常務董事”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這你不需要過問。你的指揮權在我們手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"準確來說，是在那邊那位馬克維茨先生的手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人麥基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬克維茨......你知道該怎麼辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_courtyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受傷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，是在格擋的時候受傷的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時沒什麼感覺......也許傷到骨頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該去請一個醫生，這會影響你之後的發揮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，用冰敷一下吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"法術不能治療嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以緩解疼痛和促進創口癒合，但如果是骨折的話，處理不好會留下後遺症的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦......下一場比賽的對手是風騎士......也是一名強敵，要是帶著傷的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......佐菲婭，別這麼擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讓人怎麼能不擔心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一些輕傷，我已經習以為常了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣的......還算輕傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......你這麼努力，變得這麼強，是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"為了奪得冠軍嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“在規則之中戰勝不了規則的主人”，叔叔是這麼說的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是瑪恩納他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔說的是對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我們要戰勝的，並非制定規則的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要打破的是規則本身。我們要教那些被馴化的站起身來，讓那些墮落的重回光明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔他......只是不相信，不相信還有人會跟隨著燈塔的指引，向風暴發起衝擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是能驅散這苦暗，人們總是會前進的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......這幾天，你得聽醫生的話，靜養。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"下一場比賽是對付風騎士吧？如果你不能在那之前恢復過來，後果很嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"......別像我一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"明知手臂不行了還要勉強自己，最後只能淪落到這個下場了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不勞各位費心了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐！你看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新的臂鎧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這真是......驚人的速度，我以為至少要到明天才能調整好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有我的話，那估計得花上個兩三天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"之前沒有根據你的新武器調整護臂的結構，再說之前也不知道怎麼調整啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"不過有了這一次教訓，瑪莉婭的動作很快呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瑪莉婭，我認識一些優秀的工匠。也許我該把他們介紹給你認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎！？他們是哪裡的工匠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯、萊塔尼亞、東國、拉特蘭，都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......哇......那不是有一整支高規格的工匠團......嗯？不過製藥企業真的需要一支工匠團嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就等你有機會去親眼確認了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我突然記起來，有一年你的生日，瑪恩納叔叔給你買了一台小型無人機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果你當天下午就把它拆掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我後來不是又拼起來了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候她就令我驚為天人了，雖然拼好以後其實就不能飛了，但一個孩子竟然有著這麼強的天賦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"——不過那時候我總覺得瑪莉婭也會成為騎士來著。不然我早該把工坊託付給瑪莉婭啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"趁早吧，科瓦爾，我怕你不知道哪天就歸西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？你在咒我早死嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想做自己感興趣的事情嗎？瑪莉婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我還不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，瑪莉婭還年輕得很呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......像這樣聊天，真是很久沒有過了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我把給姐姐的凝膠修復液落在工坊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"新的臂鎧還需要調試......很快就是比賽了吧？我這就去拿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（姐姐......明明是挺重的傷......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（只是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"夢魘拖著長兵，在地上劃出呲呲火星。\n他的怒火令他沉吟，他循著光的味道，來到此地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——咿呀！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你，不是她......你是......對了，你是她的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......她在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——！你想找姐姐，做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的決鬥還沒有結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"但是比賽已經結束了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"比賽......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"我漫長的天途可不是為了一場比賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士將是我這條道路上不可或缺的存在......這神聖的決鬥......竟被外人打斷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就贏下和血騎士的比賽，下一輪不就可以和姐姐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"比賽......騎士比賽......花裡胡哨的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"規則，觀眾，聽聽他們的歡呼！你難道沒有感受到那可笑的褻瀆嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac13_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"這就是騎士競技？你贏得了什麼？你又得到了什麼？\n榮譽、財富、家族的復甦，但少了什麼......對，少了什麼。\n沒有過多思考的時間，就彷彿回應這片歡呼似的，瑪莉婭還是高高舉起了劍。\n只有手臂上傳來鮮明的疼痛，足以蓋過掌聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"豈可把我與那些供人把玩的弄臣相提並論！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是怯薛的後裔，我必須完成天途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開，我對軟弱的孩子沒有興趣，我要找的是那個耀騎士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓你過去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你只不過是耀騎士的一個扈從。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......扈、扈從？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你的美夢是別人給的，你的信念是從別處借的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然能以年輕為藉口，來替你的迷茫開脫......但這又有什麼意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"世人可以笑耀騎士迂腐執拗，但誰能否定她行為的強大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，你連騎士都不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......讓開，否則我的刀刃將割破你的喉嚨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能，讓你見到姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"她在逃避？不，能綻放出那般光彩的耀騎士不會是這種人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，她受傷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你要說，我在決鬥中打傷了她，所以要等她痊癒之後，再發起挑戰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"厚顏無恥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（好重——比泰特斯的槍還重！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"看你，已遭恐懼浸染......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你根本做不到在我的面前鎮定自如地揮舞武器，若是在戰場上，你已是一具屍體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"這和......騎士與否無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想，保護，姐姐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士輪不到你保護，不知天高地厚的天馬......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......這種箭矢，與那青色的弓手相去甚遠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"離那個孩子遠點，夢魘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......巴特巴雅爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要......阻攔我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭！快，站起來，到我這邊來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"你瘋了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是你第一次問我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為，至少你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"你無處可歸了，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你的可汗在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"怯薛的長旗在哪裡？大軍的王帳又在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"歷史已經過去上千年了......你活在一個怎樣的過去？為什麼要追尋那樣的傳統？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"這些東西能給你帶來什麼？孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"拓拉。\n你的名字，意味著“草原”。\n你要，以你的血統為豪。\n在任何時候，任何地方，你都該為自己而驕傲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"拓拉。\n你要作為一個普通的庫蘭塔活著，這是很簡單的。\n讀書，長大，學會一些手藝活，娶一個漂亮的老婆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"巴特巴雅爾。從我的母親死在野獸的獠牙下時，我就已經下定了決心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我自己的夢魘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼鬼話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"我掙扎了很多年，在這個......騎士之國。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"但最後，我還是被指引向了這條道路，為了實現我最後的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢著，慢著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"難道，你這趟旅程是為了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用多說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你很衰老了，但是，你畢竟久經沙場。如果你執意阻攔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"那我將踏過你，將親自打倒我為數不多的血親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧。我將向前衝鋒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"弗格瓦爾德師傅——躲開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭，沒事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"不能讓這個瘋子去找姐姐......否則......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......攔住我，是指殺死我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在卡西米爾的騎士，真的還懂得廝殺為何物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你們做不到。巴特巴雅爾，你老了，而這匹不諳世事的天馬，你對大地的殘酷一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你們阻攔我與她的決鬥，即是在玷污我們雙方的名譽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"名譽之類的東西......根本不重要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——那你的姐姐是在為什麼而戰！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你膽敢大放厥詞！難道耀騎士執意在特錦賽奪冠，不正是為了重拾榮光嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"褻瀆者，提起武器！你會付出代價！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......我還是......不會讓你過去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"絕不！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_204na_platnm","aliases":["白金"]}]}
